{"ID":"20240506082119-s1s5z2m","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082119-s1s5z2m","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082119-s1s5z2m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627104615-895q421\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612135232-ivijijz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2700,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627105147-3onkvg0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"242石龙子（蜥蜴）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821170053"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627104615-895q421","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627104615-895q421","updated":"20240627104615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 457px;","style":"width: 447px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙子-20240627104615-2h0of9u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 447px;\" parent-style=\"width: 457px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821165447-fybj7mi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821165447-fybj7mi","updated":"20240821170053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 667px;","style":"width: 657px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627104917-745bhcj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 657px;\" parent-style=\"width: 667px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627105302-mhfmmmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627105302-mhfmmmf","updated":"20240627105302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 668px;","style":"width: 658px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙子8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙子8-20240627105259-t3vy06l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 658px;\" parent-style=\"width: 668px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 581px;","style":"width: 571px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙子7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙子7-20240627105147-z7mv158.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 571px;\" parent-style=\"width: 581px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627105323-8kznw5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627105323-8kznw5e","updated":"20240821165456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 624px;","style":"width: 614px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙子6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙子6-20240627105016-xjsk0h6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 614px;\" parent-style=\"width: 624px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 633px;","style":"width: 623px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙子2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙子2-20240627104700-jnbld9v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 623px;\" parent-style=\"width: 633px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240627104802-jdv4blc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627104802-jdv4blc","updated":"20240821170037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 435px;","style":"width: 425px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙子3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙子3-20240627104803-gd04odx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 425px;\" parent-style=\"width: 435px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 765px;","style":"width: 755px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙子-20240821170037-tqkjecn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 755px;\" parent-style=\"width: 765px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612135642-voefu7f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135642-voefu7f"}},{"ID":"20240612135700-qh8i0m8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135700-qh8i0m8","updated":"20240612135707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135700-yxsxxjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135700-yxsxxjr","updated":"20240612135700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135700-2f7w8va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135700-2f7w8va","updated":"20240612135700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主五癃邪，结气，破石淋，下血，利小便水道。一名蜥易。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135700-odu34m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135700-odu34m7","updated":"20240612135700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：石龙子，一名守宫，一名石蜴，一名石龙子，（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135700-m21hub0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135700-m21hub0","updated":"20240612135700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名山龙子，一名守宫，一石石蜴，生平阳及荆山石间，五月取着石上令干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135700-4tj1y92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135700-4tj1y92","updated":"20240612135700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：蜥、虫之蜥易也，易，蜥易，蝘蜓，守宫也，象形，蝘在壁曰蝘蜓，在草曰蜥易，或作蝘，蚖、荣蚖蛇，医以注鸣者。《广雅》云：蛤蚧，（口卢）（虫厘），蚵（虫龙），蜥蜴也。《尔雅》云：蝾螈，蜥蜴，蜥蜴，蝘蜓，蝘蜓，守宫也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135700-baui1gm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135700-baui1gm","updated":"20240612135700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《毛诗》云：胡为虺蜴，《传》云蜴，螈也。陆玑云：虺蜴，一名蝾螈，蜴也，或谓之蛇医，如蜥蜴，青绿色，大如指，形状可恶。方言云：守宫，秦晋西夏谓之守宫，或谓之（口卢）蜥（虫厘），或谓之蜥易，其在泽中者，谓之易锡，南楚谓之蛇医，或谓之蝾螈，东齐，海岱谓之蝾螈，北燕谓之祝蜓，桂林之中，守宫大者而能鸣，谓之蛤蚧。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135643-v6bn9nk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135643-v6bn9nk"}},{"ID":"20240612135719-s4pup0p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135719-s4pup0p","updated":"20240612135724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135719-vacccdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135719-vacccdb","updated":"20240612135719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜥蜴也，今人但呼为蜴蜥。大者长七八寸，身有金碧色。仁庙朝，有一蜥蜴在右掖门西浚沟庙中，此真是蜥蜴也，郑状元有诗。有樵者于涧下行，见一蜥蜴自石罅中出，饮水讫而入。良久，凡百十次，尚不已。樵者疑不免，翻石视之，有冰雹一二升。樵人讶而去，行方三五里，大雨至。良久，风雹暴作。今之州县依法用此祈雨。经云∶治五癃，破石淋，利水道。亦此义乎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135719-xtu3pom","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135719-xtu3pom"}},{"ID":"20240612135749-bu9s39n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135749-bu9s39n","updated":"20240612135755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135749-sh702gc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135749-sh702gc","updated":"20240612135749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，有小毒。主治五癃邪结气，破石淋，下血，利小便水道。一名蜥蜴，一名山龙子，一名守宫，一名石蜴。生平阳川谷，及荆山石间。五月取，着石上令干。（恶硫黄、斑蝥、芜荑。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612135749-6w3dnj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135749-6w3dnj9","updated":"20240612135749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其类有四种∶一大形，纯黄色，为蛇医母，亦名蛇舅母，不入药；次似蛇医，小形长尾，见人不动，名龙子；次有小形而五色，尾青碧可爱，名断蜴，并不螫人；一种喜缘篱壁，名蜓，形小而黑，乃言螫人必死，而未常闻中人。案东方朔云∶“若非守宫则蜥蜴”。如此蜓名守宫矣。以朱饲之，满三斤，杀，干末以涂女子身，有交接事便脱，不尔如赤志，故谓守宫。今此一名守宫，犹如野葛、鬼臼之义也，殊难分别。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135749-k1cx58u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135749-k1cx58u"}},{"ID":"20240612135734-9psyp55","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135734-9psyp55","updated":"20240612135741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子《濒湖炮炙法》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135734-o1be4kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135734-o1be4kq","updated":"20240612135734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔时珍曰〕古方用酥炙或酒炙。惟治传尸劳瘵天灵盖丸，以石蜥蜴连肠肚，以醋炙四十九遍用之，亦一异也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135734-kjtvp7u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135734-kjtvp7u"}},{"ID":"20240612135644-cycjkz2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135644-cycjkz2","updated":"20240612135647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135644-a67syoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135644-a67syoe","updated":"20240612135644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，有小毒。主五癃邪结气，破石淋，下血，利小便，利水道。一名蜥蜴，一名山龙子，一名守宫，一名石蜴。生平阳川谷及荆山山石间，五月取，着石上令干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135633-3d10t89","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135633-3d10t89"}},{"ID":"20240612135634-mss79o0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135634-mss79o0","updated":"20240612135638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135634-y2bb8hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135634-y2bb8hn","updated":"20240612135634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生石涧中，形似龙而小。《衍义》云∶能至风雨，故利水道，通五癃邪结气，破石淋下血。有四种∶在草泽者，名蝾螈、蜥蜴；在壁者，名 蜒、守宫。以五色具者为雄而良，色不具者为雌乃劣耳。入药当用草泽中者。五月采，去腹中物，火干用之。恶硫黄、斑蝥、芜荑。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135614-bsbzygu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135614-bsbzygu"}},{"ID":"20240612135625-sfkyiap","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135625-sfkyiap","updated":"20240612135628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135625-uwxo8iu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135625-uwxo8iu","updated":"20240612135625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」山龙子、泉龙、石蜴、晰蜴、猪婆蛇、守宫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135625-smvj6rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135625-smvj6rx","updated":"20240612135625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」咸、寒、有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135625-oqi9ft6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135625-oqi9ft6","updated":"20240612135625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612135625-plnqw2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135625-plnqw2i","updated":"20240612135625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、小儿阴肿。用晰蜴一具，烧成灰，酒送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135625-6ho9xzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135625-6ho9xzw","updated":"20240612135625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、诸瘘不愈。用晰蜴（炙）三个、地胆（炒）三二具、斑蝥（炒）四十个。共研为末，加蜜做成丸子，如小豆在。每服二丸，开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135625-j02v5sv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135625-j02v5sv","updated":"20240612135625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、药物流产。用晰蜴肝、蛇脱皮等分，苦酒均匀，擦妊发脐上及左右，令温暖，能使生胎产下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135614-ic7s1ow","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135614-ic7s1ow"}},{"ID":"20240612135615-6slf0a9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135615-6slf0a9","updated":"20240612135619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135615-mvsbxdw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135615-mvsbxdw","updated":"20240612135615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸温小毒。《纲目》作咸寒，误。产平阳山谷荆襄等处，其类有四。一种生岩石间，头扁身长，尾与身等，长七八寸，大者尺余，其状若蛇。而脚似梅花，鳞目五色者为雄，色黄身短者为雌。此物最惜鳞甲，故见人不动，捕之亦不螫人，以其生岩石间。故《本经》谓之石龙子，以其善于变易吞霾吐雹，有阴阳析易之义，故《字林》谓之蜥蜴，楚人名为蝾螈，实一物也。入药雌雄并用，去头足酒浸酥炙用之。入传尸药醋炙用之。一种生草泽间，头大尾短身粗，其色青黄，有伤则衔草自敷，故谓之蛇医母，能入水与石斑鱼合，故又名水蜥蜴，不入药用。一种生人家屋壁，形小身细，长三四寸，色褐斑黑者谓之 蜓，吴俗名为壁虎，以其居壁而善捕蝎蝇也。或云，饲之以朱，点宫娥臂，故名守宫。一种似守宫而头圆身细，长五六寸，色白如银，通身细鳞，雌雄上下相应而鸣，情洽乃交者，蛤蚧也。荆襄岭泽皆有，而西川产者最胜。捕得成对线缠，炙干卷榕树皮中者是也。以此明辨，方无误用之失。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135615-tqrv9vy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135615-tqrv9vy","updated":"20240612135615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子为《本经》中品，而《纲目》主治中有《别录》，而无《本经》，岂《本经》之文有所残缺欤，抑《本经》之文误注《别录》欤？其治五癃邪结气，利小便水道，破石淋下血者，以蜥蜴能吐雹祈雨，故治癃淋利水道，是其本性。《千金》治症结水肿尸疰留饮，有蜥蜴丸，《外台》治阴 方用之，皆取其长于利水道耳。按∶蜥蜴即是石龙。今房术药中用之，以其兴发助阳而无止涩之患也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135229-gah8jhm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135229-gah8jhm"}},{"ID":"20240612135257-ghvj9ng","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135257-ghvj9ng","updated":"20240612135316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135257-mhhdrrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135257-mhhdrrm","updated":"20240612135257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒，主五癃邪结气破，石淋下血，利小便水道，一名蜥蜴，生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135257-w94mk73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135257-w94mk73","updated":"20240612135257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"析易阴阳，荆山盈数，鱼跃浮交，蝉栖巧捕，召雨含冰，兴云拥雾，从壁上观，守宫丹注，"}]},{"ID":"20240612135257-ejv6rh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135257-ejv6rh4","updated":"20240612135257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"埤雅：蜴善变易：有阴阳析易之义。名医曰：生荆州山石间。抱朴子：虺蜴盈数。异物志：鱼跳跃，蜥蜴从草中下依，近共浮水而相合。古今注：善于树上捕蝉食之。卦爻名义注：与龙通气，故可祈雨。与蛇同形，故能吐雹。倦游杂录：京师久旱以瓮贮水，插柳枝泛蜥蜴。小儿呼曰：蜥蜴蜥蜴，兴云吐雾。说文：在壁者曰蝘蜓。史记纪：诸将皆从壁上观。博物志：蜥蜴食以朱砂，体尽赤，捣点女人肢体，终身不灭，故曰守宫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135229-p8892xh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135229-p8892xh"}},{"ID":"20240612135239-bbbtpkd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135239-bbbtpkd","updated":"20240612135308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135239-7204p4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135239-7204p4o","updated":"20240612135239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，有小毒。主五癃邪结气，破石淋，下血，利小便水道。一名蜥蜴，一名山龙子，一名守宫，一名石蜴。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135239-oi615qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135239-oi615qw","updated":"20240612135239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生平阳川谷，及荆山石间。五月取，着石上令干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135239-o7xh1mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135239-o7xh1mq","updated":"20240612135239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶硫黄、斑蝥、芜荑。其类有四种∶一大形，纯黄色，为蛇医母，亦名蛇舅母，不入药；次似蛇医，小形长尾，见人不动，名龙子；次有小形而五色，尾青碧可爱，名断蜴，并不螫人；一种喜缘篱壁，名 蜓，形小而黑，乃言螫人必死，而未常闻中人。案东方朔云∶若非守宫，则蜥蜴是，如此 蜓名守宫矣。以朱饲之，满三斤，杀，干末以涂女子身，有交接事便脱，不尔如赤志，故谓守宫。今此一名守宫，犹如野葛、鬼臼之义也，殊难分别。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135239-afe3c82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135239-afe3c82","updated":"20240612135239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕"}]},{"ID":"20240612135239-f437v4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135239-f437v4l","updated":"20240612135239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此言四种者∶蛇师，生山谷，头大尾短小，青黄或白斑者是； 蜓，似蛇师，不生山谷，在人家屋壁间，荆楚及江淮人名 蜓，河济之间名守宫，亦名荣螈，又名蝎虎，以其常在屋壁，故名守宫，亦名壁宫，未必如术饲朱点妇人也，此皆假释尔。其名龙子及五色者，并名蜥蜴，以五色者为雄而良，色不备者为雌，劣尔，形皆细长，尾与身相类，似蛇，着四足，去足便直蛇形也。蛇医则不然。案《尔雅》亦互言之，并非真说。又云朱饲满三斤，殊为谬矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135229-9ch6xuv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135229-9ch6xuv"}},{"ID":"20240612135230-7bsy3py","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-7bsy3py","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：石龙子"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-n1hxvyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-n1hxvyg","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-zde17w8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-zde17w8","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shí Lónɡ Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-eu2c985","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-eu2c985","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-1arocpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-1arocpt","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 四脚蛇、草龙"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-bm5s8sf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-bm5s8sf","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-r8dxs7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-r8dxs7y","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 石龙子科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"铜石龙子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Sphenomorphus indicus （Gray）或同属其它种石龙子的活体或干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春夏秋皆可捕，晒干或烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-gqz6xn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-gqz6xn8","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-xvfgma2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-xvfgma2","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-ku5s42w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-ku5s42w","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-v0b9p7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-v0b9p7d","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解毒消肿，镇痉祛风。用于淋巴结结核，乳癌，肺痈，癫痫，风湿皮肤发痒及疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-10a32gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-10a32gf","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-8jfa09t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-8jfa09t","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 0.5～1钱。作散剂或熬膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-gpmtvgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-gpmtvgf","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-672dtdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-672dtdc","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）同属动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"花楔蜥"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Sphenomorphus maculatus （Blyth）。亦同供药用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-ms21fut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-ms21fut","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-3ihxmbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-3ihxmbm","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-0wycoi8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-0wycoi8","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：石龙子"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-qzhr4xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-qzhr4xd","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-p09b1zv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-p09b1zv","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shí Lónɡ Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-cghydor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-cghydor","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-hoobbnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-hoobbnk","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜥蜴（《本经》），山龙子、守宫、石蜴（《别录》），泉龙（《春秋繁露》注），猪婆蛇（《纲目》），五寸棍（《陆川本草》），四脚蛇（《四川中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-ugwoccs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-ugwoccs","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-7f7o19o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-7f7o19o","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-s77o0ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-s77o0ow","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-nnkl2eu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-nnkl2eu","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为石龙子科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"石龙子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-bbvylxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-bbvylxw","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-4r98n0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-4r98n0q","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 栖于山野草丛中，爬行迅速。分布长江流域和以南地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-dd8n150","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-dd8n150","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-8nmhfvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-8nmhfvy","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全长约21厘米。周身被有覆瓦状排列的角质细鳞，鳞下分布骨片；鳞片质薄，光滑，鳞列24～26行。吻端圆凸，鼻孔1对，鼻后鳞缺如；眼分列于头部两侧，眼间距宽；舌短，稍分叉。体背面粘土色，一般有3条纵走的淡灰色线；鳞片周缘淡灰色，因而呈现网状斑纹。四肢发达，前肢5指，后肢5趾，指、趾端均有钩爪。尾细长，末端尖锐，易断，断后能再生。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-w8j1zdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-w8j1zdm","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙子种类很多，分布较广的尚有蓝尾石龙子（长江流域以南）、铜石龙子（华南、华中）等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-cdqk04m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-cdqk04m","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-47r38t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-47r38t3","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-k6i3p4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-k6i3p4v","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-8daptvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-8daptvw","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-554j548","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-554j548","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》：\"咸，温，小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-svtnaqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-svtnaqh","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-gsqt4is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-gsqt4is","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经集注》：\"恶硫黄、斑苗（蝥）、无夷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-50r45ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-50r45ua","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"娠妇忌用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-9nyraaq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-9nyraaq","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-ah8bf0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-ah8bf0v","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 破结，行水。治小便不利，石淋，恶疮瘰疬，臁疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-elf4lip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-elf4lip","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主五癃邪结气，破石淋，下血，利小便水道。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-2urwvnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-2urwvnu","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"消水饮阴癀，滑窍破血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-nl9ce3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-nl9ce3j","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草求原》：\"偏助壮火，阳事不振者宜之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-gblx562","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-gblx562","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《四川中药志》：\"治九子烂疡，乳癌，肺痈，风湿，皮肤发痒及疮毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-qtzhydo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-qtzhydo","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-g3nx9j1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-g3nx9j1","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：烧存性，0.5～1钱；或入丸、散。外用：熬膏或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-yejx9pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-yejx9pf","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-vepaofh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-vepaofh","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治小儿颓：蜥蜴一枚，烧灰，末，以酒服之。（《备急方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-mzler63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-mzler63","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治诸瘘不愈：蜥蜴（炙）三枚，地胆（炒）三十枚，斑蝥（炒）四十枚。为末，蜜丸小豆大。每服二丸，白汤下。（《刘涓子鬼遗方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-ptih04c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-ptih04c","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治久年不愈的臁疮，九子烂疡及一切无名肿毒：石龙子、壁虎、千脚虫、滚山珠、娱蚣虫、铧头尖蛇等分。熬膏外用，或泡桐油外搽。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-6s9j9y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-6s9j9y3","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-v21hjri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-v21hjri","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-84peocv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-84peocv","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：石龙子"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-fl49icw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-fl49icw","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-8w8jc0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-8w8jc0d","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shí Lónɡ Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-lcs25vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-lcs25vm","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-mlnojnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-mlnojnk","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜥易、易蜴、蜥蜴、山龙子、守宫、石蜴、猪蛇婆、四脚蛇、五寸棍"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-twni25i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-twni25i","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-9icrppv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-9icrppv","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Chinese Skink"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-tjrjfoz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-tjrjfoz","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-cuhhgbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-cuhhgbj","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自1.《本经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-1hxtxb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-1hxtxb9","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.陶弘景：石龙子，其类有四种，一大形纯黄色为蛇医母，亦名蛇舅母，不入药。次似蛇医，小形长尾，见人不动，名龙子。次有小形而五色，尾青碧可爱，名断蜴，并不螫人。一种喜缘篱壁，名yan蜒，形小而黑，乃言螫人必死，而未尝闻中人。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-n6oa9jy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-n6oa9jy","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：诸说不定，大抵是水旱二种，有山石、草泽、屋壁三者之异，《本经》惟用石龙，后人但称蜥蜴，实一物也。且生山石间，正与石龙、山龙之名相合"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-ro7i5oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-ro7i5oy","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-1zt4kay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-1zt4kay","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为石龙子科动物石龙子或蓝尾石龙子除去内脏的全体。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-2cwzbji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-2cwzbji","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Eumeces chinensis(Gray)2.Eumeceselegans Boulenger"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-m7w9nmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-m7w9nmb","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋间捕捉，处死，除内脏，置通风处干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-zvf6mri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-zvf6mri","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-pjprfpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-pjprfpn","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生活于海拔200-1000m的山区、平原耕作区、开阔地、住宅、路旁杂草乱石堆中捕食昆虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-e3jt0uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-e3jt0uj","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生活于海拔600-1500m左右山间路旁杂草间。捕食昆虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-kcui8bp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-kcui8bp","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、福建、台湾、湖北、湖南、广东、海南、广西、四川、贵州、云南。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-lh7jnmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-lh7jnmm","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、福建、台湾、河南、湖北、湖南、广东、广西、四川、贵州、云南。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-mgntefp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-mgntefp","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-9tl0qp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-9tl0qp1","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.石龙子，头体头103-125mm，尾长144-189mm。眶上鳞第2枚显着大于第1枚；额顶鳞发达，彼此相切，有上鼻鳞；无后鼻鳞；第2列下颞鳞楔形，后颏鳞前、后2枚。耳孔前缘有2-3个瓣突，鼓膜深陷。体较粗壮，环体中段鳞22-24行；肛前具1对大鳞；尾下正中行鳞扩大。前、后肢贴体相向时不相遇，指、趾侧扁掌足冰粒鳞大、小不一。背面灰橄榄色；头部棕色；颈侧及体侧红棕色，雄性更为显着，体侧有分散的黑斑点；腹面白色。幼体背面黑灰色，有3条浅黄色纵纹向后直达尾部，随个体成长而消失或隐约可见。雄性颞部显着隆肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-ec5kksv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-ec5kksv","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.蓝尾石龙子，头体长70-90mm，尾长130-160mm，吻端顿圆；上鼻鳞1对，左右相切，无后鼻鳞，前额鳞1对，不相切；额鼻鳞与额鳞相接，左右顶鳞为间顶鳞所隔开，颊鳞2，眶上鳞4，耳孔前缘有2-3枚锥状鳞，上唇鳞7，后颏鳞1枚，体鳞平滑，环体中段鳞26-28；肛前鳞2，股后缘有1簇大鳞，雄性肛侧各有1棱鳞。背面深黑色，有5条黄色纵纹，正中条在顶鳞分叉向前达吻部，其余分别在眼上方和眼下方向后沿体侧达尾部，在尾后端浅纵纹消失。尾部为蓝色，腹面色浅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-ginpws7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-ginpws7","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-auuwp7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-auuwp7e","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品野生。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-90osm7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-90osm7g","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-j1oq8vn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-j1oq8vn","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品有抗癌作用，其醇提取物能抑制人肝癌细胞的呼吸；体内试验，可延长移植肿瘤动物的寿命。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-np2h2nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-np2h2nj","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-iug0nab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-iug0nab","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 捕得后处死，割除内脏，洗净，置通风处干燥，或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-kjlrml2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-kjlrml2","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-79a3o3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-79a3o3g","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味咸；性寒；小毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-geju6x1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-geju6x1","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-2xstjjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-2xstjjy","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-3ps64mg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-3ps64mg","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-eiz6tt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-eiz6tt9","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 利水通淋；破结散瘀；解毒。主癃闭；石淋；小便不利；恶疮；臁疮；瘰疬"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-u362dbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-u362dbm","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-akv4fox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-akv4fox","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：烧存性研末，1.5-3g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，熬膏涂；或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-euoy5p4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-euoy5p4","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-dhjwj9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-dhjwj9b","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主五癃邪结气，破石淋，下血，利小便水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-4nowuat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-4nowuat","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：消水饮阴，滑窍破血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-y8n66zs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-y8n66zs","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草求原》：偏助壮火，阳事不振者宜之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-e8vxa4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-e8vxa4y","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《四川中药志》：治九子烂疡，乳癌，肺痈，风湿,皮肤发痒及疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-qilixmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-qilixmm","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612135230-x3hxmpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135230-x3hxmpq","updated":"20240612135230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612135231-ccj8dg2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612135231-ccj8dg2"}},{"ID":"20240612135232-ivijijz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612135232-ivijijz"}}]}